# Phase-1 SEO / GEO tool wires

Harness behavior for Phase-0 GO / CONDITIONAL-GO adopts owned by this wiki. Prefer policy here; runtime for E-GEO / geo-optimizer / wondelai is the federation skill `adopted-geo-tools`.

## Dual GEO Claude Code skills (GO 2026-05-07)

- Classical local SEO → **claude-seo-agrici** (GBP, citations, local pack). Generative/AEO citability → **geo-seo-claude**. Do not install a third parallel `/seo` skill pack (@entities/tools/seo-geo-claude-skills.md is Steal-from only).
- Pair citability audits with Aggarwal tactics (Quotation / Statistics / Fluency) — never keyword stuffing.
- Copy frameworks → **marketingskills**; schema generation in WordPress → **Yoast** (skill audits; Yoast writes markup).

## Adopted GEO helpers (runtime via `adopted-geo-tools` + MCP)

- Service-page AI-citation rewrites → `python3 scripts/e_geo_rewrite_service_page.py` (facts only; operator CMS paste). Playbook: @concepts/e-geo-universal-rewrite-playbook.md.
